OL,3,GNEWSA'My skin makes me unique and I'm
OL,4,Alearning to embrace it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman born with a rare genetic skin
OL,7,Fcondition that covers 98% of her body
OL,8,Fin birthmarks has spoken of how she is
OL,9,Flearning to embrace her appearance
OL,10,Fafter years of trying to hide it.
OL,12,FLaura Kelly, 28, was born with
OL,13,Fcongenital melanocytic naevus (CMN) and
OL,14,Funderwent 14 operations as a baby, with
OL,15,Fdoctors fearing she may not live beyond
OL,16,Fthe age of eight.
OL,18,FLaura said CMN made her self conscious
OL,19,Fabout how strangers might react and
OL,20,Fthat, growing up as a teenager, she
OL,21,Foften wore heavy makeup and planned
OL,22,Foutfits to cover her skin.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
