OL,3,GNEWSA'My skin makes me unique and I'm
OL,4,Alearning to embrace it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said embracing how she looks and
OL,7,Fraising awareness of CMN has given her
OL,8,Fmore confidence and hopes sharing her
OL,9,Fstory will help others with a visible
OL,10,Fdifference.
